note dq8r: one q8_0 block (34 bytes) dequantised to 32 f32: y = f32(q) * d, as ggml-cpu dequantize_row_q8_0.
fn dq8r w view uchar 34 y edit f32 32 to void
d = h2f ushort or ulong get w 0 shl ulong get w 1 8
for j ulong 32
q = long get w add 2 j
if ge q 128
q = sub q 256
end
put y j mul f32 q d
end
end
